      "writtenOn": "2026-03-13T00:48:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`bio_chain()` does:\n\n```\n 385         bio-\u003ebi_private \u003d parent;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            \n 386         bio-\u003ebi_end_io  \u003d bio_chain_endio;                                                                                                                                                                                                                                   \n 387         bio_inc_remaining(parent);                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           \n```\n\nbasically what `zram` does (well, open coded, sort of). Probably we need to switch to `bio_chain()`.",
