      "writtenOn": "2026-03-13T00:55:45Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, actually no... we set `bio-\u003ebi_private` to handle async completion (deferred recompression etc.), and `bio` doesn\u0027t quite like that. There is this:\n\n```\nBUG_ON(bio-\u003ebi_private || bio-\u003ebi_end_io);\n```\n\nat the very start of `bio_chain()`. So that\u0027s why we had to open code it and workaround it.",
      "parentUuid": "ecb6e1a1_4bb7a4bb",
